Commonly Used Spring Boot Annotations

In enterprise Spring Boot applications, annotations are divided by their functional layers:
• Core / DI: @Component, @Service, @Repository, @Autowired, @Qualifier, @Value.
• Web / REST: @RestController, @RequestMapping, @GetMapping, @PostMapping, @PutMapping, @DeleteMapping, @PatchMapping, @PathVariable, @RequestParam, @RequestBody.
• Configuration: @Configuration, @Bean, @SpringBootApplication, @EnableTransactionManagement.
• Validation: @Valid, @NotNull, @NotBlank, @Size, @Min, @Max.

